OL,3,GNEWSAMurder investigation as woman dies
OL,4,Aafter fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA murder investigation is under way
OL,7,Fafter a 48-year-old woman died in a
OL,8,Ffire in west London.
OL,10,FOfficers were called to a residential
OL,11,Faddress on Berkeley Avenue, Hounslow,
OL,12,Fat about 01:15 BST on Wednesday
OL,13,Ffollowing reports of the blaze, the
OL,14,FMetropolitan Police said.
OL,16,FSix men and three women were taken to
OL,17,Fhospital, where the 48-year-old woman
OL,18,Fdied. Another woman, 40, is in a
OL,19,Flife-threatening condition.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
