OL,3,GNEWSAMurder investigation as woman dies
OL,4,Aafter fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Met said no arrests had been made
OL,7,Fbut officers believed the fire may have
OL,8,Fbeen started deliberately. Det Ch Insp
OL,9,FNeil John said: "Our inquiries are
OL,10,Fprogressing at pace as we work to
OL,11,Festablish the full circumstances
OL,12,Fsurrounding the fire."
